      "metadata": {
        "phase": "none"
      },
      "file": "chunk_004.pcm",
      "size_bytes": 1010974
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Later that same trip, Liu Yang went to see \"The Wandering Earth 3\"—he was the one who bought the ticket, not me.",
